PRGSTART
//A PROGRAM THAT IS NOTHING BUT THE TEN SECTIONS OF THE LOGIC//

SECTION VARS,//WHERE EVERY NAME IN THE PROGRAM IS DECLARED//
ENDSECT VARS

SECTION INVALS,//WHAT RUNS ONCE BEFORE ANYTHING ELSE DOES//
ENDSECT INVALS

SECTION MAIN,//THE BODY OF THE PROGRAM//
ENDSECT MAIN

SECTION MAINSUBS,//SUBROUTINES THE BODY CALLS//
ENDSECT MAINSUBS

SECTION OPMACS,//ONE PIECE OF LOGIC PER OPERATION MACRO//
ENDSECT OPMACS

SECTION DEFSUBS,//SUBROUTINES USED WHILE A DEFINITION IS READ//
ENDSECT DEFSUBS

SECTION ERR,//WHAT TO DO WHEN SOMETHING IS WRONG//
ENDSECT ERR

SECTION ENVPR,//PRINTS THE STATE OF THE PROCESSOR//
ENDSECT ENVPR

SECTION MACNAMES,//THE NAMES THE OPERATION MACROS ANSWER TO//
ENDSECT MACNAMES

SECTION DELS,//DELIMITERS AND KEYWORDS//
ENDSECT DELS

PRGEND
